# Campaign music on the ORIGINAL (tools/capture/run_audio_wsl.sh): the same
# screens and keys as ../scripts/music.keys, each screen held by emulated time
# (wait:, MWSNAP's own; the original's empty polls take almost no emulated
# time, so idle: can't hold a screen there). The title's length decides the
# start world (the campaign draws a random number on every poll), and with
# 36 s it is the port's.
wait:36000 @snap:title
Return Return @snap:hub
Down Down Down Down @snap:bar_sel
Return wait:36000 @snap:bar
